  "_comment": "Wire version -> index -> STAGE for the Pendulum Color battle wire. That wire carries version, index, power and attribute and NO stage field, and the attack table is keyed on the stage -- so a stage has to come from somewhere. The index alone is not enough: 19 of 34 indexes name more than one stage across the eight versions (index 21 is a Child on one, an Ultimate on another and a Super Ultimate on a third). The PAIR is exact -- 0 of 259 records ambiguous. Kept in src/data rather than read off the module, because the opponent is a real device whether or not the player owns PENC, and that is exactly when the module is not there to ask.",
